## JSR Subsystem

Foundation layer — core data models, course generation, CLI utilities.

Deno-first, Node.js compatible. Published to `jsr.io/@tutors/*`.

![w:900](img/05-jsr-subsystem.png)

---

## JSR — Model Package

**`@tutors/tutors-model-lib`** — Core data structures & types

```typescript
interface Lo {
  type: LoType;     // "course" | "topic" | "lab" | "talk" | etc.
  title: string;
  route: string;
  los?: Lo[];       // Child learning objects
}

interface Course extends Lo {
  type: "course";
  url: string;
  topicIndex: Map<string, Lo>;
}
```

---

## JSR — Gen Package

**`@tutors/tutors-gen-lib`** — Course content generation

- **CourseBuilder** — Scan folders, identify Lo types, build course tree
- **ResourceBuilder** — Parse markdown frontmatter & content
- **TemplateEngine** — Vento-based HTML rendering
- **CourseEmitter** — Write `tutors.json` or static HTML

---

## Svelte Package Ecosystem

Six layers from foundation to UI — each building on the layer below.

![h:450](img/06-svelte-ecosystem.png)

---

## Runes Package

**`@tutors/runes`** — Global reactive state using Svelte 5 runes

```typescript
export const currentCourse = {
  get value() {
    return (_currentCourse ??= rune(null)).value;
  },
  set value(v) {
    (_currentCourse ??= rune(null)).value = v;
  }
};
```

Lazy initialization avoids SSR issues.

---

## Course Package

**`@tutors/course`** — Course loading, processing, markdown rendering

- **courseService** — Fetch JSON, cache, decorate tree
- **LiveLab** — Lab step navigation & markdown fetching
- **markdownService** — Shiki highlighting, Mermaid diagrams, Marp rendering

