## Applications — SvelteKit Architecture

All apps follow the same structure:

- **Reader** — Main course viewer (`/course`, `/lab`, `/talk`, `/video`, `/note`)
- **Catalogue** — Course discovery & statistics
- **Live** — Real-time student presence tracking

Route groups: `(auth)/`, `(course-reader)/`, `(home)/`

---

